\fBReadable (extends Stream)\fR
Emitted when there is data available to read. Emitted when a chunk of data is available. Emitted when no more data will be provided. Emitted when the stream and any of its underlying resources have been closed. Emitted if an error occurs.
.TP
\fBWritable (extends Stream)\fR
Emitted when it is safe to write more data. Emitted when all data has been flushed to the underlying system. Emitted when the stream and any of its underlying resources have been closed. Emitted if an error occurs.
.TP
\fBDuplex (extends Readable)\fR
Duplex streams are both readable and writable.
